      417.52,
      542.54,
      466.99
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the Powers vested in me under the Section (I) of 66 (C) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and the provision of section 66 (G) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance, I do hereby informed that the name mentioned below was elected and declared by me as New Chairman of Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha in Batticaloa District with in the meeting held on the day of 07.08.2025 at 10.00 am at the Manmunai Pattu Pradeshiya Sabha Hall.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
